日上市漲幅榜上，2305 全友、2338 光罩、3016 嘉晶均以漲停 10.00% 作收，成交量分別為 17665 張、12836 張、13980 張。跌幅榜上，3376 新日興下跌 8.01%，2308 台達電下跌 6.69%。在當沖熱門個股方面，竟天以 19.9 倍的量比（相對自己爆量）位居第一，顯示交易熱絡，該股今日上漲 13.33%。光罩、環科、亞通等個股的量比也相對較高。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"上市漲幅榜：2305 全友 (+10.00%)、2338 光罩 (+10.00%)、3016 嘉晶 (+10.00%)。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"上市跌幅榜：3376 新日興 (-8.01%)、4912 聯德控股-KY (-6.92%)、2308 台達電 (-6.69%)。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"當沖熱門（量比高）：竟天 (量比 19.9x, +13.33%)、光罩 (量比 10.1x, +10.00%)、環科 (量比 9.5x, +0.40%)。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"個股代號\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"名稱\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"漲跌幅\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"成交量 (張)\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"量比 (倍)\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"2305\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"全友\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"+10.00%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"17665\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"-\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"2338\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"光罩\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"+10.00%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"12836\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"10.1x\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"3016\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"嘉晶\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"+10.00%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"13980\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"-\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"3376\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"新日興\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"-8.01%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"19831\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"-\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"2308\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"台達電\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"-6.69%\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"20433\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"-\"}]]}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_fig__uoT7r\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figFrame__jJ7E4\",\"children\":\"✓外資現貨買超✓自營商現貨賣超✓外資期貨淨空單\"}],[\"$\",\"figcaption\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_figCap__LnUbb\",\"children\":\"法人動向重點\"}]]}]]]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-4\",{\"id\":\"sec-4\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"四、法人動向與籌碼概況\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"今日法人在現貨市場的買賣超呈現分歧。外資在現貨市場買超約 435,313 張，而自營商則賣超約 599,848 張。在期貨方面，外資台指期淨空單為 83,918 口。全市場融資維持率（衡量信用交易風險的指標）為 190.1%，顯示整體市場的信用交易風險仍在可控範圍，但投資人仍需留意個別股票的變化。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"外資現貨買超約 435,313 張。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"自營商現貨賣超約 599,848 張。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"外資台指期淨空單 83,918 口。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"全市場融資維持率為 190.1%。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"法人類別\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"現貨買賣超 (張)\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"期貨淨部位 (口)\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"外資\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"+435,313\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"-83,918 (淨空單)\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"自營商\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-599,848\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"-\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-5\",{\"id\":\"sec-5\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"五、國際市場與相關新聞\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"國際股市方面，美國主要指數漲跌互見，S&P 500 下跌 0.48%，那斯達克下跌 0.64%，而費城半導體指數則逆勢上漲 0.37%。亞洲市場方面，韓國綜合指數（KOSPI）下跌 0.25%，日經 225 指數則小幅上漲 0.20%。今日台股相關新聞標題包括『廣達：8月營收創新高 滾量大漲』、『一張不起眼的銅箔基板，為什麼8月可以讓台光電做到201億營收？』，這些都是今日市場關注的焦點。國際新聞則提到『IMF因川普關稅言論放棄首席經濟學家頭號人選』以及『中國表示希望「早日」與美國達成關稅減讓協議』，顯示國際貿易政策仍是重要議題。\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"S&P 500 指數下跌 0.48%，那斯達克指數下跌 0.64%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"費城半導體指數上漲 0.37%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"韓國綜合指數（KOSPI）下跌 0.25%，日經 225 指數上漲 0.20%。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"今日台股新聞標題：焦點股》廣達：8月營收創新高 滾量大漲；營收速報》伺服器出貨大增 廣達8月營收寫新猷；筆電越賣越少，營收卻衝破4,200億？廣達真正的本體已經不是筆電；一張不起眼的銅箔基板，為什麼8月可以讓台光電做到201億營收？；營收：輔信(2405)8月營收1億5370萬元，月增率-6.96%，年增率1.66%；輔信營收／8月1.53億元、年增1.65% 聚焦中高階產品出貨。\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"近三日川普／美國政策相關標題：IMF因川普關稅言論放棄首席經濟學家頭號人選；中國表示希望「早日」與美國達成關稅減讓協議；川普承諾若共和黨贏得期中選舉，將向美國公民發放5,000美元「分紅」。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tblScroll__z9kbb\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_tbl__0yNgv\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"thead\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"tr\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"國際主要指數\"}],[\"$\",\"th\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"漲跌幅\"}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"S&P 500\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.48%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"那斯達克\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.64%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"費城半導體\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"+0.37%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"韓國綜合 (KOSPI)\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"-0.25%\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"4\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"td\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"日經 225\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"+0.20%\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]]]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-6\",{\"id\":\"sec-6\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"常見問題 FAQ\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faq__cemBp\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"details\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"今天台股大盤收盤是多少？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"今日（2026-09-10）台股加權指數收盤為 46940.49 點，下跌 0.51%。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"今天哪些族群表現比較好？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"今日盤面中，電子商務業、創新版股票、造紙工業以及文化創意業表現相對較強，呈現上漲。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"外資今天在台股現貨市場是買超還是賣超？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"根據公開資料，外資今日在台股現貨市場買超約 435,313 張。\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqItem__I9h0U\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"children\":\"今天有哪些股票漲停？\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_faqA__IPuvc\",\"children\":\"今日上市漲幅榜上，2305 全友、2338 光罩、3016 嘉晶均以漲停 10.00% 作收。\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n21:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-7\",{\"id\":\"sec-7\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"總結\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_p__aZlQ1\",\"children\":\"今日台股加權指數與櫃買指數同步下跌，市場整體偏弱，但電子商務、造紙等部分族群仍有相對表現。外資現貨買超，自營商賣超，國際股市漲跌互見。\"}]]]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"section\",\"sec-8\",{\"id\":\"sec-8\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_section__hLVjU\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_h2__NmJ08\",\"children\":\"延伸閱讀\"}],[[\"$\",\"ul\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"LearnArticle_list__WjxqC\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-查看今日戰情\",{\"href\":\"/diary\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"查看今日戰情\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-了解台股學堂\",{\"href\":\"/school\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"了解台股學堂\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-閱讀台股日報\",{\"href\":\"/diary\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"閱讀台股日報\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",\"0-大盤總覽分析\",{\"href\":\"/diary\",\"className\":\"LearnArticle_link__gMwHV\",\"children\":\"大盤總覽分析\"}]]}]]}]]]}]\n13:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nf:null\n23:I[80622,[],\"IconMark\"]\n11:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"2026-09-10 台股盤後：大盤收跌0.51%，電子商務相對有撐｜股市大佬 TradeBoss\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"今日（2026-09-10）台股大盤加權指數收在 46940.49 點，下跌 0.51%，整體市場氣氛偏弱。櫃買指數也同步走低，顯示中小型股表現相對承壓。盤面上，電子商務與造紙工業族群表現相對較強。\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"16x16\"}],[\"$\",\"$L23\",\"3\",{}]],\"error\":null,\"digest\":\"$undefined\"}\n16:\"$11:metadata\"\n"}